OL,5,G1125 Traffic Cops
OL,6,     FWith over 1000 people killed or
OL,7,     Fseriously injured by uninsured,
OL,8,     Funlicensed or disqualified drivers
OL,9,     Feach year, Derbyshire's traffic
OL,10,     Fcops set out to tackle illegal and
OL,11,     Fdangerous drivers.
OL,12,G1230 Matt Allwright
OL,13,     FMatt looks at the big news stories
OL,14,     Fdeveloping during the day and
OL,15,     Foffers help and advice to save you
OL,16,     Fmoney and make your lives a little
OL,17,     Feasier.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG3/10
