OL,5,G1330 Car Pound Cops
OL,6,     FIn Surrey, Police Traffic
OL,7,     FOfficers, John and Sean seize an
OL,8,     Funtaxed car with Bulgarian plates,
OL,9,     Fand discovers that both the driver
OL,10,     Fand vehicle have a complicated
OL,11,     Fpast. (Ep12)
OL,12,G1400 Police Interceptors
OL,13,     FA horsebox carries an illegal
OL,14,     Fload, one of the team's top cars
OL,15,     Fbecomes a victim of a drink-driver
OL,16,     Fand a road user gets a lesson.
OL,17,G1500 Police Interceptors
OL,18,     FJason is short of festive cheer
OL,19,     Fwhen a yuletide party becomes a
OL,20,     Ffull-blown riot. Adam and Nick
OL,21,     Funcover a drunk mother driving her
OL,22,     Fdaughter to the shops.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG4/10
