OL,5,G1600 Police Interceptors
OL,6,     FScott and Adam discover a huge
OL,7,     Fstash in the boot of a car, and a
OL,8,     Frunaway dealer just misses mowing
OL,9,     Fdown Gary.
OL,10,G1700 Call the Bailiffs: Time to...
OL,11,     F...Pay Up! From early-morning
OL,12,     Fstakeouts to high-value commercial
OL,13,     Fdebts, agents track a debtor who
OL,14,     Fowes service charges and help a
OL,15,     Fhotel guest claim compensation for
OL,16,     Flost luggage.
OL,17,G1800 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,18,     FEmergency situations compel Dr
OL,19,     FBeecraft, Dr Glynne and Dr Swanne
OL,20,     Fto refer their patients for
OL,21,     Fspecialist treatment.
