OL,5,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,6,     FCouples visit the GPs together
OL,7,     Fthis week. David's wife is worried
OL,8,     Fthat he may have dementia, but he
OL,9,     Fthinks she is being over-dramatic.
OL,10,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,11,     FYorkshire's A&E struggles with too
OL,12,     Fmany patients and not enough room
OL,13,     Ffor them as they work to treat
OL,14,     Finternal chest wounds, a collapsed
OL,15,     Flung and a back injury.
OL,16,G2100 999: Critical Condition
OL,17,     FMotorcyclist Danny is rushed into
OL,18,     Fthe emergency department following
OL,19,     Fa high-speed road traffic accident
OL,20,     Fin north Wales.
