OL,5,G0000 The Surgeon
OL,6,     FBehind the surgeon's mask - from
OL,7,     Fthe pressurised operating theatre
OL,8,     Fto life at home - as consultant
OL,9,     Fheart surgeon Inder Birdi faces
OL,10,     Fone of the most challenging cases
OL,11,     Fof his career.
OL,12,G0100 Fatal First Dates
OL,13,     FA teen thought she was chatting to
OL,14,     Fthe boy of her dreams, but the guy
OL,15,     Fshe believed was 17, was really a
OL,16,     F47-year-old man grooming her
OL,17,     Fbefore kidnapping her - with fatal
OL,18,     Fconsequences.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG8/10
